        "selection": "Select one uniform primary pool by maximum aggregate screening-correct, then fewer execution errors, then smallest SHA256 of the three ordered champion source hashes, then arm ID only for identical programs. Commit primary choice before confirmation. Evaluate all three already frozen pools and unchanged as predeclared confirmation comparators. No model calls, program changes or primary reselection after screening. Costs are reported independently, not used as a tie breaker.",
